                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Not a bad game at all! A much simpler, Indie version of what the Heroes of Might & Magic games are but simple in a way that keeps you hooked with the mechanics, leveling up and customization as well as the combat/battles. It's engaging and I kept wanting go for another run. It's a short game but a replayable one, especially since the difficulty on normal is a bit high. After reading advice online about this game before starting it, I played my campaigns on easy mode and, sure enough, after just short of 8 hours, I finished it. Not without dying 3 or 4 times first, though. And there's no save game feature, only a resume game feature, when you decide to leave it,... once you die, you start over. Nothing amazing or original but rather a clever, intuitive and fun little indie strategy RPG!",
